REQUEST / SCOPE
Prioritize Vendors/vendor management under Tools. POS transactions are excluded;
automatic sync remains the last priority. No sample business records.
Explicit user correction: no backward compatibility and no schema upgrades;
testing uses uninstall/recreation. This overrides migration planning.

IMPLEMENTED
